<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Demo Breakdown" id="slide2">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1181" dy="630" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="800" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="raw" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#02548B;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingBottom=10;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="229" width="670" x="30" y="31" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="raw_icon" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="📝 Raw User Input" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="200" x="50" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="raw_text" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#cccccc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;This is a policy about how inventory is counted and reconciled at the end of the fiscal year.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Each warehouse is responsible for conducting a full physical count of all inventory on hand&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Once the physical count is completed, the results get compared against what&#39;s currently reflected in the system records&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Any discrepancies between the physical count and the system records need to be investigated and formally documented&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;After discrepancies are documented, adjustments get put together and submitted to the finance office for their review&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;The finance office reviews the proposed adjustments and posts them to the system before the reporting deadline&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Once everything is posted and finalized, the updated inventory numbers get reported up&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;This should follow SFFAS xx for inventory valuation and SFFAS xx for how costs get recognized during the reconciliation process.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="600" x="50" y="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="context_node" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0A3348;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingBottom=10;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="330" x="370" y="265" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="context_icon" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="✏️ Context Rewrite" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="25" width="250" x="390" y="265" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="context_field1_label" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;align=left;" value="Rewritten User Context" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="200" x="381" y="289" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="context_field1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=light-dark(#ffffff, #3e3e3e);align=left;fontFamily=Helvetica;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;The user is drafting an end-of-fiscal-year inventory reconciliation policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;A six-step sequential process beginning at the warehouse level and ending with leadership reporting. Physical inventory counts are compared against system records, discrepancies are investigated and documented, adjustments are submitted to and approved by finance, and final numbers are reported after posting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;-Specific SFFAS standard numbers not provided&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;One governs inventory valuation, the other governs cost recognition during reconciliation&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;- No system of record identified&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;- No reporting deadline defined&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;- No approver or approval authority specified&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;- No escalation threshold for discrepancies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="189" width="310" x="380" y="291" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="search_node" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1775A6;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingBottom=10;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="330" x="30" y="265" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="search_icon" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="🔍 Search Rewrite" vertex="1">
